CalldataSliceLib::sliceUint256PairArray
├── given empty array (length 0)
│   ├── it should return empty array
│   └── it should return same offset
├── given single pair
│   ├── it should return array with one pair
│   └── it should return offset + 64
├── given multiple pairs
│   ├── it should return correct array length
│   ├── it should return correct values for each pair
│   └── it should return offset + (length * 64)
└── given array at non-zero offset
    └── it should read from correct position